{"ID":"20240118145022-2paf2ur","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145022-2paf2ur","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145022-2paf2ur\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145022-mf7yrph\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122160118-hee9bqg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122160118-hee9bqg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:264,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:264\u0026#125;","title":"302连翘","type":"doc","updated":"20240204111512"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145022-mf7yrph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145022-mf7yrph","updated":"20240122160034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名异翘，一名兰华。一名折根，一名轵，一名三廉。味苦，平，无毒。治寒热，鼠瘘，瘰疬，痈肿。恶疮，瘿瘤，结热，蛊毒。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160037-8iw7eea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160037-8iw7eea"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产山谷中及泽地，处处有之，四川产者为胜。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160038-9z1nfgh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160038-9z1nfgh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦辛，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160039-eoq5qgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160039-eoq5qgs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】连翘为散结清火要药，主治疮疡，能清火解毒，消肿排脓，散血结气聚，去上焦热，通利小便。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160042-cqu7dz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160042-cqu7dz7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"[1.常与银花为伍用。]"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160043-qnwgebq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160043-qnwgebq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】去白虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160045-0p1vniy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160045-0p1vniy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】通利五淋，小便不通，除心家客热。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160046-doeewt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160046-doeewt9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】通小肠，排脓治疮疖，止痛，通月经。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160047-qz6pnid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160047-qz6pnid"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【丹溪】泻心火，除脾胃湿热，治中部血证以为使。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160049-wcoa1jj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160049-wcoa1jj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【东垣】散诸经血结气聚，消肿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160050-hagudnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160050-hagudnr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】连翘亦象心包，而质轻扬，味征苦，故轻扬上达，能清心与上焦头目之热，其无辛散之气，故不主散。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160052-kqwx3am","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160052-kqwx3am"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】散郁火，治疮疡。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160054-74l1njn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160054-74l1njn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【倪注】此药常与银花同用，皆属味清而质轻，皆能升清气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160056-mclxlem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160056-mclxlem"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160057-yn24jk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160057-yn24jk3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】连翘清而无补之药也，痈疽已溃及日久，火热由于虚，与脾胃薄弱作泄者均忌，忌火。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160034-axc6bcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160034-axc6bcn"}},{"ID":"20240122160058-bwn8o3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160058-bwn8o3r"}},{"ID":"20240122160059-sl86n29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160059-sl86n29","updated":"20240204111312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三O二，连翘，连翘就是我们常常使用的药物，连翘，长成这样子。这连翘呢，你们看这产地，四川产者最好，四川的连翘品质最好，这个性味呢，味苦，辛，苦味辛味。连翘，是散结清火的主要的药，张仲景使用上面也是在清火解毒，消肿排脓上面，那临床上面呢，包括皮肤病啊，我们有热性的症状，皮肤里面红赤，我们都会使用连翘，小便不利，小便赤痛，也会使用连翘。"}]},{"ID":"20240122160114-694kmo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160114-694kmo2","updated":"20240204111346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个[大明]呢：通小肠，排脓治疮疖，止痛，你看它所有湿热的症状，因为连翘本身药性是寒性的，所以湿热的症状，通通都可以使用。你看，连翘长得那样子。唐容川他说连翘长得象心包，心脏的外围象心包，质轻，非常地轻，味苦，所以能清心和上焦头目之热，所以说如果牙痛、鼻塞，眼睛的赤肿赤痛，青春痘都可以使用连翘."}]},{"ID":"20240122160118-hee9bqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160118-hee9bqg","updated":"20240204111512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个药呢，我们常常跟银花放在一起使用。剂量使用的时候，一般来说2钱、3钱就很多了，你不需要开很多这个连翘。虚症的人，少用，因为连翘本身就是清热，它没有滋补的功能，你可以看它这中药的样子，干干的，没有这个壳，你拿到药，比较有津液，比较湿润的，都有滋补的功能在里边，比如你看到知母，有没有？麦冬，有没有？当归。生地、熟地，这些都有，你看这连翘干干的，象个壳这样，象花生壳一样，瓜子壳，它本身没有滋补功能，它就是清毒，没有滋补的功能。没滋补药性的时候，虚症的人，很虚的人不用，经方里面，我们有麻黄连翘赤小豆这个方子在里边；"}]}]}